@startuml kairos-member-login-sequence
title Member Login (no MFA)

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "Auth Provider" as Auth
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Enter email/password\nClick "Login"
MemberApp -> API: POST /auth/login {email, password}
API -> Auth: Validate credentials
Auth --> API: Success + userId + roles=[Member]
API -> DB: SELECT Member by userId
DB --> API: Member record
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {jwt, memberSummary}

MemberApp --> Member: Redirect to Member Dashboard

@enduml
